  612                   ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  613                   ; get state of CONSOLE (if character is available)
  614                   
  615 E37C  C3 F012     CONST:	JP 0F012H
  616                   
Z80ASM SuperFast Relocating Macro Assembler     	    Z80ASM 1.32 Page   8
